(4815296, 695894, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image is nice using rule of thirds.  PP leaves a bit to be desired,though.  Maybe a bit more contrast and possibly color correction because the image is very green.</td>', 'Image is nice using rule of thirds.  PP leaves a bit to be desired,though.  Maybe a bit more contrast and possibly color correction because the image is very green.', '2008-07-09 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
