(4815321, 694975, 35602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful city image.  Love the stars.  Your exposure is right on.  No glare that I can see.  Also, the colors and refelctions are awesome.</td>', 'Beautiful city image.  Love the stars.  Your exposure is right on.  No glare that I can see.  Also, the colors and refelctions are awesome.', '2008-07-09 16:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815322, 695016, 69046, '<td valign="top">Love the old feel, how''d you do it?  9</td>', 'Love the old feel, how''d you do it?  9', '2008-07-09 16:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815323, 696801, 35602, '<td valign="top">How desolate.  Like the almost monochrome look of the grays.  Nicely placed horizon line. Needs to be bigger though.</td>', 'How desolate.  Like the almost monochrome look of the grays.  Nicely placed horizon line. Needs to be bigger though.', '2008-07-09 16:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815326, 696647, 35602, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  Love the light on the field and the bales.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  Love the light on the field and the bales.', '2008-07-09 17:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815340, 696485, 35602, '<td valign="top">I am sure this was a hard shot to get.  Anyway, the colors seem too blue for some reason, and there is a great deal of pixelization, as if you might have had a much smaller image and tried to enlarge it.  Nice perspective, though.  Perhaps a zoom lens, or maybe a closer vantage would have given a higher quality image.</td>', 'I am sure this was a hard shot to get.  Anyway, the colors seem too blue for some reason, and there is a great deal of pixelization, as if you might have had a much smaller image and tried to enlarge it.  Nice perspective, though.  Perhaps a zoom lens, or maybe a closer vantage would have given a higher quality image.', '2008-07-09 17:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815347, 696682, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Seems a bit overprocessed, though.  The blue way too saturated for my tastes, and the land area in the foreground is really broken up.  Still, I am sure with that rainbow it was an idyllic image to view when you were there.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Seems a bit overprocessed, though.  The blue way too saturated for my tastes, and the land area in the foreground is really broken up.  Still, I am sure with that rainbow it was an idyllic image to view when you were there.', '2008-07-09 17:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815352, 695436, 35602, '<td valign="top">I know you were trying to get a primeval look to the image, sort of like the original King Kong.  I like the affect.  Nice light and contrast.  Wish I could see it three times as big.  It is probably truly extraordinary.</td>', 'I know you were trying to get a primeval look to the image, sort of like the original King Kong.  I like the affect.  Nice light and contrast.  Wish I could see it three times as big.  It is probably truly extraordinary.', '2008-07-09 17:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815390, 696914, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is fun!</td>', 'This is fun!', '2008-07-09 17:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815412, 696277, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Love the purple flowers in the foreground.  Great sky and exposure.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Love the purple flowers in the foreground.  Great sky and exposure.', '2008-07-09 17:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815413, 696509, 36051, '<td valign="top">wow!!</td>', 'wow!!', '2008-07-09 17:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815418, 696319, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think you might have left too much uninteresting sky in for the nature of the photo.  The sunflowers are much more interesting, but being so low and with camera flare, it takes a great deal away from what could have been a great photo.  Try a polarizer or nd filter to cut out the flare and to create a better sky.</td>', 'I think you might have left too much uninteresting sky in for the nature of the photo.  The sunflowers are much more interesting, but being so low and with camera flare, it takes a great deal away from what could have been a great photo.  Try a polarizer or nd filter to cut out the flare and to create a better sky.', '2008-07-09 17:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815422, 695716, 35602, '<td valign="top">The shot overall seems uninteresting for a landscape.  Might work better in a pattern challenge.  Also, the clutter I find unsettling.</td>', 'The shot overall seems uninteresting for a landscape.  Might work better in a pattern challenge.  Also, the clutter I find unsettling.', '2008-07-09 17:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815434, 695172, 93868, '<td valign="top">Forest Gump?</td>', 'Forest Gump?', '2008-07-09 17:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815687, 697071, 92907, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit dark</td>', 'Seems a bit dark', '2008-07-09 19:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815690, 694990, 92907, '<td valign="top">seems a bit oof</td>', 'seems a bit oof', '2008-07-09 19:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815692, 697097, 92907, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the hazy look.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the hazy look.', '2008-07-09 19:46:09.000000', NULL, 1);
