(4815697, 696941, 86447, '<td valign="top">The natural framing of this is wonderful.  Add in that gorgeous sunset and that surprise boat and this is a contender for the podium.</td>', 'The natural framing of this is wonderful.  Add in that gorgeous sunset and that surprise boat and this is a contender for the podium.', '2008-07-09 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
