(4815700, 695188, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... a different kind of sunset than we usually see...  this one with all of the layers of focus, the foreground, the pier and the city.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful... a different kind of sunset than we usually see...  this one with all of the layers of focus, the foreground, the pier and the city. Well done.', '2008-07-09 19:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
