(4817398, 696439, 89468, '<td valign="top">Is there a dog on the rocks? Just wondering is taking attention away from the smokey water and the sky. Rock could have been even darker. But the overall picture is very nice and zen, I like it.</td>', 'Is there a dog on the rocks? Just wondering is taking attention away from the smokey water and the sky. Rock could have been even darker. But the overall picture is very nice and zen, I like it.', '2008-07-10 14:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
