(4817723, 696988, 56275, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting angle. Almost makes me dizzy, but I like it. Good crisp shot, nice colors.</td>', 'This is a really interesting angle. Almost makes me dizzy, but I like it. Good crisp shot, nice colors.', '2008-07-10 18:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
