(4817732, 696919, 56275, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo, the more I like it. Well composed, great colors, and such detail! 10</td>', 'The more I look at this photo, the more I like it. Well composed, great colors, and such detail! 10', '2008-07-10 18:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
