(4818315, 696984, 28882, '<td valign="top">this is nice but i can see gradient artifacts, or whatever you call them, in the water.  still very nice.</td>', 'this is nice but i can see gradient artifacts, or whatever you call them, in the water.  still very nice.', '2008-07-11 00:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818327, 696913, 28882, '<td valign="top">this is super.  where most people would shoot this without people, here you''ve done one better by leaving them in.   great exposure.</td>', 'this is super.  where most people would shoot this without people, here you''ve done one better by leaving them in.   great exposure.', '2008-07-11 00:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818329, 695899, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  i would normally avoid shooting at this time, i guess thats what make it special.</td>', 'nice shot.  i would normally avoid shooting at this time, i guess thats what make it special.', '2008-07-11 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818352, 695904, 67237, '<td valign="top">Hmmm the Radio Observation deck again...the sigma 10-20, and so for. Hanheld?<br/>You are running out of subjetcs my friend :-)</td>', 'Hmmm the Radio Observation deck again...the sigma 10-20, and so for. Hanheld?You are running out of subjetcs my friend :-)', '2008-07-11 00:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818357, 695830, 67237, '<td valign="top">beautiful!!  9</td>', 'beautiful!!  9', '2008-07-11 00:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818361, 695396, 36006, '<td valign="top">architectural, not landscape unless you are considering your frame, then yes, you are right.<br/> <br/>The tonal value needs help, your whites are not there, and your blacks dip into the abyss.</td>', 'architectural, not landscape unless you are considering your frame, then yes, you are right. The tonal value needs help, your whites are not there, and your blacks dip into the abyss.', '2008-07-11 00:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818373, 695254, 36006, '<td valign="top">Not framed in landscape, and not a landscape by traditional thought.<br/> <br/>A way too busy snapshot of a crowd of people, all wearing hats of similar make.<br/>You''re not letting me care, what am I supposed to look at? The only thing that stands out is the ''Rendezvous'' sign. <br/> <br/>I guess I see the coincidence on the sign, and the crowd, but then, why didn''t you title the image to help me know  what''s on your mind?<br/> <br/>Your tonal value is just ok, the whites are there, barely, but your blacks seem to dip into the abyss.<br/> <br/>A shoehorn like this is way too obvious, and won''t make any big marks in a DPC contest.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Not framed in landscape, and not a landscape by traditional thought. A way too busy snapshot of a crowd of people, all wearing hats of similar make.You''re not letting me care, what am I supposed to look at? The only thing that stands out is the ''Rendezvous'' sign.  I guess I see the coincidence on the sign, and the crowd, but then, why didn''t you title the image to help me know  what''s on your mind? Your tonal value is just ok, the whites are there, barely, but your blacks seem to dip into the abyss. A shoehorn like this is way too obvious, and won''t make any big marks in a DPC contest. Good luck.', '2008-07-11 00:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818381, 696218, 36006, '<td valign="top">Three questions.<br/> <br/>1)Where is the naked woman?<br/> <br/>2)Where is the banana?<br/> <br/>3)Where s the landscape?<br/> <br/>good luck.</td>', 'Three questions. 1)Where is the naked woman? 2)Where is the banana? 3)Where s the landscape? good luck.', '2008-07-11 00:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818435, 697002, 93868, '<td valign="top">Love it. That''s all I can say lol. 9</td>', 'Love it. That''s all I can say lol. 9', '2008-07-11 01:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818436, 695830, 93868, '<td valign="top">That''s an amazing photo, lucky to have found such a great opprtunity. 9 form me.</td>', 'That''s an amazing photo, lucky to have found such a great opprtunity. 9 form me.', '2008-07-11 01:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818437, 696557, 93868, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.</td>', 'Very nice image.', '2008-07-11 01:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818707, 696801, 40355, '<td valign="top">A good example of a bleak landscape, very monochromatic, which I like - seems an accurate depiction.  However, it is unfortunate that it is so small and that the crop over-extended on the bottom &amp; right, giving you that white area; these two elements really detract from the overall.</td>', 'A good example of a bleak landscape, very monochromatic, which I like - seems an accurate depiction.  However, it is unfortunate that it is so small and that the crop over-extended on the bottom & right, giving you that white area; these two elements really detract from the overall.', '2008-07-11 07:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818708, 695370, 40355, '<td valign="top">More city and less empty sky would have made this a stronger photo.</td>', 'More city and less empty sky would have made this a stronger photo.', '2008-07-11 07:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818710, 696622, 40355, '<td valign="top">I love IR photography and this shot has some especially strong elements; the glory of the central tree, the excellent shadow beneath it, the dramatic sky.  However, my one complaint is that the central tree really blends into the background trees in several places.  Tricky to avoid I''m sure, and still a great shot. 8</td>', 'I love IR photography and this shot has some especially strong elements; the glory of the central tree, the excellent shadow beneath it, the dramatic sky.  However, my one complaint is that the central tree really blends into the background trees in several places.  Tricky to avoid I''m sure, and still a great shot. 8', '2008-07-11 07:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818713, 696943, 40355, '<td valign="top">Both the crab and the building are dead center in the frame, and you cut off the crab''s tail.  A more dynamic composition would have earned you more points.</td>', 'Both the crab and the building are dead center in the frame, and you cut off the crab''s tail.  A more dynamic composition would have earned you more points.', '2008-07-11 07:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818715, 695602, 40355, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this shot, the contrasting colors.  Excellent use of texture, color, and form.  10</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this shot, the contrasting colors.  Excellent use of texture, color, and form.  10', '2008-07-11 07:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818716, 696871, 40355, '<td valign="top">One of the best fireworks shots I''ve seen in a very long time.  Excellent balance with the city/water.  Just lovely overall, a sure 10.</td>', 'One of the best fireworks shots I''ve seen in a very long time.  Excellent balance with the city/water.  Just lovely overall, a sure 10.', '2008-07-11 07:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818717, 697090, 40355, '<td valign="top">I love the muted colors of the landscape with the last hint of saturating in the sky.  Excellent dynamic between the soft water and the sharp rocks and trees.  Exposure looks spot on - just a great shot overall.  10</td>', 'I love the muted colors of the landscape with the last hint of saturating in the sky.  Excellent dynamic between the soft water and the sharp rocks and trees.  Exposure looks spot on - just a great shot overall.  10', '2008-07-11 08:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818718, 696647, 40355, '<td valign="top">I love the color scheme used here - very warm, makes it feel exactly like the title.  Very well done, 10.</td>', 'I love the color scheme used here - very warm, makes it feel exactly like the title.  Very well done, 10.', '2008-07-11 08:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
