(4819459, 697027, 90658, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop on the right.  Not so much to take away all of the pink, but enough to make the tree seem even more "out of place."</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop on the right.  Not so much to take away all of the pink, but enough to make the tree seem even more "out of place."', '2008-07-11 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
