(4820182, 697108, 13207, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous, love the colours and the clarity of this image.  My first 10 in this challenge.  Great job!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous, love the colours and the clarity of this image.  My first 10 in this challenge.  Great job!', '2008-07-12 00:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820183, 695379, 13207, '<td valign="top">Brilliant in its simplicity - I love it.</td>', 'Brilliant in its simplicity - I love it.', '2008-07-12 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820186, 696919, 13207, '<td valign="top">An awesome capture of beautiful location - can''t wait til this challenge is over so I can see the details about it - a new place to mark on my vacation wishlist!</td>', 'An awesome capture of beautiful location - can''t wait til this challenge is over so I can see the details about it - a new place to mark on my vacation wishlist!', '2008-07-12 00:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820188, 695172, 13207, '<td valign="top">I love the softness of this image.  It would have been great without the little boy in the oak - with him in there makes it excellent.  Innocence and wistfulness is what I see.  Beautiful/</td>', 'I love the softness of this image.  It would have been great without the little boy in the oak - with him in there makes it excellent.  Innocence and wistfulness is what I see.  Beautiful/', '2008-07-12 00:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820189, 696512, 13207, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I''m a real fan of b&amp;w images - not to sure how it will do for a landscape challenge in b&amp;w but I think it works - it seems to emphasize the vastness of your shot where leaving this in colour might have ended up looking too busy.  Would be curious to see the colour version.</td>', 'I like this, but I''m a real fan of b&w images - not to sure how it will do for a landscape challenge in b&w but I think it works - it seems to emphasize the vastness of your shot where leaving this in colour might have ended up looking too busy.  Would be curious to see the colour version.', '2008-07-12 00:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820191, 696440, 13207, '<td valign="top">2nd time around, bumping this up - I love the vibrancy of the colours - clean, simple image.</td>', '2nd time around, bumping this up - I love the vibrancy of the colours - clean, simple image.', '2008-07-12 00:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820379, 696451, 95720, '<td valign="top">Awesome Shot.  Love the lines and color.  The reflection is great as well.  Great shot!</td>', 'Awesome Shot.  Love the lines and color.  The reflection is great as well.  Great shot!', '2008-07-12 03:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820436, 696320, 83548, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  1.</td>', 'I don''t get it.  1.', '2008-07-12 06:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820466, 695172, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a sweet scene, though I almost didn''t notice the little boy. I wonder if it would be stronger were he wearing something of a different colour - nothing too bright, maybe blue or yellow? Then again, perhaps you wanted him to blend in?</td>', 'What a sweet scene, though I almost didn''t notice the little boy. I wonder if it would be stronger were he wearing something of a different colour - nothing too bright, maybe blue or yellow? Then again, perhaps you wanted him to blend in?', '2008-07-12 07:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820467, 696049, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and I like your use of the shore rocks as a vertical foreground.</td>', 'Lovely light and I like your use of the shore rocks as a vertical foreground.', '2008-07-12 07:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820468, 697044, 3087, '<td valign="top">Inclusion of foreground trees lifts it from a straight shot of a modern office block reflection. I don''t like the white border.</td>', 'Inclusion of foreground trees lifts it from a straight shot of a modern office block reflection. I don''t like the white border.', '2008-07-12 07:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820469, 696487, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, gorgeous colours reflected onto the clouds and water.</td>', 'Wow, gorgeous colours reflected onto the clouds and water.', '2008-07-12 07:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820470, 697076, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very vivid. Nice.</td>', 'Very vivid. Nice.', '2008-07-12 07:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820472, 696682, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic clouds and rainbow!</td>', 'Very dramatic clouds and rainbow!', '2008-07-12 07:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820474, 695904, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like your choice to include only a small sliver of sky.</td>', 'Nicely done, I like your choice to include only a small sliver of sky.', '2008-07-12 07:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820475, 696647, 3087, '<td valign="top">Even knowing this was taken in the golden morning light the toning seems _too_ yellow. A sweet bucolic image though.</td>', 'Even knowing this was taken in the golden morning light the toning seems _too_ yellow. A sweet bucolic image though.', '2008-07-12 07:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820476, 695577, 3087, '<td valign="top">Looks very inviting.</td>', 'Looks very inviting.', '2008-07-12 07:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820478, 695379, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way this is almost an abstract; it could almost be modern art. I can imagine taking four or five sheets of differently toned paper, ripping the shapes out of them, scrunching them up a bit and glueing them down... I like that effect!</td>', 'I like the way this is almost an abstract; it could almost be modern art. I can imagine taking four or five sheets of differently toned paper, ripping the shapes out of them, scrunching them up a bit and glueing them down... I like that effect!', '2008-07-12 07:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820480, 694551, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way the clouds smudge the moon so that it contrasts with the clean shapes of the city lights.</td>', 'I like the way the clouds smudge the moon so that it contrasts with the clean shapes of the city lights.', '2008-07-12 07:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820482, 696440, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an interesting affect, almost like a painting! I like the limited colour palette - that bright blue, that vivid green, lots of white and then a little dark green, black and yellow to finish.</td>', 'Wow, what an interesting affect, almost like a painting! I like the limited colour palette - that bright blue, that vivid green, lots of white and then a little dark green, black and yellow to finish.', '2008-07-12 07:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820484, 695277, 3087, '<td valign="top">The traffic looks like a molten river of lava streaming through the city...</td>', 'The traffic looks like a molten river of lava streaming through the city...', '2008-07-12 07:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820485, 694925, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple and evocative of desert nights.</td>', 'Simple and evocative of desert nights.', '2008-07-12 07:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820487, 695899, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and the massively limited colour palette, just blues, greens and some shadow black. The harsh noon light works well to create strong contrasts.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and the massively limited colour palette, just blues, greens and some shadow black. The harsh noon light works well to create strong contrasts.', '2008-07-12 07:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
