(4826522, 696512, 42013, '<td valign="top">A little flat and lifeless to my eye. I also find that the strong horizontal line accross the bottom really keeps me from soaking in the rest of the scene. Make sense??? I hope so...</td>', 'A little flat and lifeless to my eye. I also find that the strong horizontal line accross the bottom really keeps me from soaking in the rest of the scene. Make sense??? I hope so...', '2008-07-15 17:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826523, 696832, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene. You''ve caught a nice reflection. The read boat really catches my eye, weighting the picture to that side and I wish it were oriented so it drew my eye into the scene rather than out of it. Looks like wet feet would be necessary. ;)</td>', 'Very pretty scene. You''ve caught a nice reflection. The read boat really catches my eye, weighting the picture to that side and I wish it were oriented so it drew my eye into the scene rather than out of it. Looks like wet feet would be necessary. ;)', '2008-07-15 17:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826526, 695830, 42013, '<td valign="top">Overly dramatic shadows and dark sky for my taste. I do like what IR does for the greens though.</td>', 'Overly dramatic shadows and dark sky for my taste. I do like what IR does for the greens though.', '2008-07-15 17:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826528, 695769, 42013, '<td valign="top">I can almost feel the coolness. Good job. You might give it just a smidge of USM to bring out the texture of the mosses.</td>', 'I can almost feel the coolness. Good job. You might give it just a smidge of USM to bring out the texture of the mosses.', '2008-07-15 17:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826532, 696319, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the idea-just wish the contrast weren''t quite so high. I''d love to see a little cloud detail and a little more detail in the sunflowers.</td>', 'I like the idea-just wish the contrast weren''t quite so high. I''d love to see a little cloud detail and a little more detail in the sunflowers.', '2008-07-15 17:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826536, 695925, 42013, '<td valign="top">Colors are great! I would suggest a slight change in composition in this case. Use the rule of thirds and move your main stack to the right third of the frame. Sometimes rules can be broken but I don''t think this is one of those times.</td>', 'Colors are great! I would suggest a slight change in composition in this case. Use the rule of thirds and move your main stack to the right third of the frame. Sometimes rules can be broken but I don''t think this is one of those times.', '2008-07-15 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826540, 694457, 42013, '<td valign="top">Ahhh what a nice view. Ditto what everyone else said about the horizon. ;)<br/> <br/> <br/>I would encourage you to look for alternative viewpoints when shooting bridges. YOurs is pretty static because of the center/yet unbalanced compositon. Take a look at <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=36606" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">alexsaberi</a> profile and his Pride of London shot for ideas.</td>', 'Ahhh what a nice view. Ditto what everyone else said about the horizon. ;)  I would encourage you to look for alternative viewpoints when shooting bridges. YOurs is pretty static because of the center/yet unbalanced compositon. Take a look at  alexsaberi profile and his Pride of London shot for ideas.', '2008-07-15 17:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
