(4826560, 697071, 42013, '<td valign="top">Overall a little dark making it hard to pick up any shadow detail. It looks like an interesting place and hopefully you''ll shoot it again. Especially with BW photos, look for a point of interest that showcases light versus dark. Without color, you need the light for impact.</td>', 'Overall a little dark making it hard to pick up any shadow detail. It looks like an interesting place and hopefully you''ll shoot it again. Especially with BW photos, look for a point of interest that showcases light versus dark. Without color, you need the light for impact.', '2008-07-15 17:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
