(4827128, 694551, 23098, '<td valign="top">Like the reflections and clouds over the moon.  The moon''s a little too bright but good image.</td>', 'Like the reflections and clouds over the moon.  The moon''s a little too bright but good image.', '2008-07-15 23:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
