(4827404, 696984, 91527, '<td valign="top">Agh, I totally thought this would ribbon, was definitely in my top 3 for this challenge.  I still think it''s an absolutely beautiful shot!</td>', 'Agh, I totally thought this would ribbon, was definitely in my top 3 for this challenge.  I still think it''s an absolutely beautiful shot!', '2008-07-16 01:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
