(4827421, 696440, 39427, '<td valign="top">Amazing clouds, congrats on the ribbon.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Amazing clouds, congrats on the ribbon.  Beautiful.', '2008-07-16 01:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827423, 697060, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how it feels like you are almost up there with the clouds.  I love how big, beautiful and fluffy they are.  Gorgeous scene.</td>', 'I love how it feels like you are almost up there with the clouds.  I love how big, beautiful and fluffy they are.  Gorgeous scene.', '2008-07-16 01:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827432, 696835, 51379, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top ten Wayne... well done!</td>', 'Congrats on your top ten Wayne... well done!', '2008-07-16 01:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827436, 696557, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oooh you squeaked it out lol.  I''m looking at those votes of 3 and laughing.  Gorgeous photo and you know it!  :D  At least I do lol.  Great job.</td>', 'Oooh you squeaked it out lol.  I''m looking at those votes of 3 and laughing.  Gorgeous photo and you know it!  :D  At least I do lol.  Great job.', '2008-07-16 01:11:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827452, 695830, 72103, '<td valign="top">By far and away my favourite, should have won easily.......................</td>', 'By far and away my favourite, should have won easily.......................', '2008-07-16 01:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827454, 696315, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene and great perspective.  I love the bits of setting sun reflecting on various buildings.  Wonderful clarity and detail all over.  So much to see - very cool...</td>', 'Wonderful scene and great perspective.  I love the bits of setting sun reflecting on various buildings.  Wonderful clarity and detail all over.  So much to see - very cool...', '2008-07-16 01:13:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827465, 696693, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and I love the sky.  The palms look nice and fluffy lol.  This is a perfect capture tho because this is exactly the kind of scene you want to see when you step out onto your balcony after a day of vacationing.  I can smell the night air now  :D</td>', 'I love the lighting and I love the sky.  The palms look nice and fluffy lol.  This is a perfect capture tho because this is exactly the kind of scene you want to see when you step out onto your balcony after a day of vacationing.  I can smell the night air now  :D', '2008-07-16 01:15:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827477, 696510, 12661, '<td valign="top">WOW!!! I would have imagined this would place much higher. I think the soft focus works perfectly here. It gives it a mystic, dreamlike feel. Had you had sharp focus of any part of the field, it would have killed the mood.</td>', 'WOW!!! I would have imagined this would place much higher. I think the soft focus works perfectly here. It gives it a mystic, dreamlike feel. Had you had sharp focus of any part of the field, it would have killed the mood.', '2008-07-16 01:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827489, 696871, 49643, '<td valign="top">Congratulation! Excellent shot with beautiful colors.</td>', 'Congratulation! Excellent shot with beautiful colors.', '2008-07-16 01:18:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827502, 696440, 49643, '<td valign="top">Everything is beautiful! Congratulations!</td>', 'Everything is beautiful! Congratulations!', '2008-07-16 01:20:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827556, 696439, 34114, '<td valign="top">Congratulations John on an excellent photo and finish!</td>', 'Congratulations John on an excellent photo and finish!', '2008-07-16 01:27:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827586, 697016, 67697, '<td valign="top">bummer - no comments lol.  I gave it a 6 and I think I did not give it a higher score because I wanted to see a little light interacting with the scene.  What a gorgeous view this must be.  I love that you can see the mountains in the far background in your photo.  I love the clouds too.</td>', 'bummer - no comments lol.  I gave it a 6 and I think I did not give it a higher score because I wanted to see a little light interacting with the scene.  What a gorgeous view this must be.  I love that you can see the mountains in the far background in your photo.  I love the clouds too.', '2008-07-16 01:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827587, 697018, 53094, '<td valign="top">This photo is really beautiful!  I just love the colors and reflections.  I''m surprised that this didn''t finish much higher.</td>', 'This photo is really beautiful!  I just love the colors and reflections.  I''m surprised that this didn''t finish much higher.', '2008-07-16 01:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827614, 696440, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely gorgeous - truly a wonderful landscape!  Congrats on the ribbon (and getting a break in the weather to get this shot!)</td>', 'This is absolutely gorgeous - truly a wonderful landscape!  Congrats on the ribbon (and getting a break in the weather to get this shot!)', '2008-07-16 01:36:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827623, 696871, 91451, '<td valign="top">and I am seeing this on the front page! :p<br/>CONGRATS!</td>', 'and I am seeing this on the front page! :pCONGRATS!', '2008-07-16 01:37:34.000000', NULL, 0),
