(4827658, 696647, 69008, '<td valign="top">Hay!  This is great! : ) <br/> I totally understand the golden tones in this image. The golden hue is quite similar to that of a landscapes entry that I did a while back.  It''s a beautiful place that you live in. I like the foreground and straight row lines into the horizon in this. It has a bigger than life look.</td>', 'Hay!  This is great! : )  I totally understand the golden tones in this image. The golden hue is quite similar to that of a landscapes entry that I did a while back.  It''s a beautiful place that you live in. I like the foreground and straight row lines into the horizon in this. It has a bigger than life look.', '2008-07-16 01:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4827672, 696941, 52549, '<td valign="top">I so glad this beauty did well, it was my favourite in the challenge. Congrats on 12th place, Peter.</td>', 'I so glad this beauty did well, it was my favourite in the challenge. Congrats on 12th place, Peter.', '2008-07-16 01:47:34.000000', NULL, 0),
