(4828776, 695486, 24454, '<td valign="top">Mae!!!   You make my heart hurt again!  I''m not sure where you live -- but I''m wanting to cancel our vacation plans and find out so we can go there.   Not that I would be able to ever capture anything that resembled THIS, but just seeing it.   You are amazing!   Congratulations!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Mae!!!   You make my heart hurt again!  I''m not sure where you live -- but I''m wanting to cancel our vacation plans and find out so we can go there.   Not that I would be able to ever capture anything that resembled THIS, but just seeing it.   You are amazing!   Congratulations! ', '2008-07-16 12:06:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828777, 696564, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow, Jimmy!   My jaw is on the floor in awe!  This is the type of scene that I wait all year to go to Colorado and be in -- and when I''m there -- I feel like surely I''m in Heaven.   You captured it flawlessly!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, Jimmy!   My jaw is on the floor in awe!  This is the type of scene that I wait all year to go to Colorado and be in -- and when I''m there -- I feel like surely I''m in Heaven.   You captured it flawlessly! ', '2008-07-16 12:08:22.000000', NULL, 0),
