(4828784, 696913, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I LOVE this!   I so disagree with Jac!  I love the people in it.  It gives such scale and perspective.   I''m thinking this is insanely underrated!<br/> <br/>Edit: ooops can''t type today.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-16 11:13:03.</i></td>', 'Oh, I LOVE this!   I so disagree with Jac!  I love the people in it.  It gives such scale and perspective.   I''m thinking this is insanely underrated! Edit: ooops can''t type today.', '2008-07-16 12:12:36.000000', '2008-07-16 12:13:03.000000', 0),
(4828794, 696315, 24454, '<td valign="top">9:30pm!  Man!  I thought it got late in Texas in the summer!   But that''s great.  It gives you time to get out after work and experience beauty and wonder like this.   This is so amazing.   I can''t imagine why you are loving Germany so much :)   Thank you for letting us enjoy it with you!<br/></td>', '9:30pm!  Man!  I thought it got late in Texas in the summer!   But that''s great.  It gives you time to get out after work and experience beauty and wonder like this.   This is so amazing.   I can''t imagine why you are loving Germany so much :)   Thank you for letting us enjoy it with you!', '2008-07-16 12:16:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828798, 696615, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!  Can I go back in and not have missed this in the challenge and give it a 10!  Maybe it would have helped a teeny tiny bit to keep this one from being so ridiculously underrated!<br/> <br/>I LOVE this.  The human element makes it so much more interesting to me.</td>', 'Ohmy!  Can I go back in and not have missed this in the challenge and give it a 10!  Maybe it would have helped a teeny tiny bit to keep this one from being so ridiculously underrated! I LOVE this.  The human element makes it so much more interesting to me.', '2008-07-16 12:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828804, 697028, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow! Another one sadly underrated!  This is breathtaking!  Oh and I just wanna go on record as saying I totally disagree with your commenter.  The foreground land adds compositional interest, without which I think would have made the picture much less dramatic!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow! Another one sadly underrated!  This is breathtaking!  Oh and I just wanna go on record as saying I totally disagree with your commenter.  The foreground land adds compositional interest, without which I think would have made the picture much less dramatic! ', '2008-07-16 12:21:46.000000', NULL, 0),
