(4829004, 696956, 70128, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by william88:</b></div><hr/><i> Argentina? cold winter now? And you worked hard for the awesome night shot. Well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the nice comment! I admit, I submitted the wrong version. There was one with not so much contrast, that I think I liked better. It can be seen <a href="//www.panoramio.com/photo/11944425" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>.<br/> <br/>BTW, yes, it''s winter here, but very warm... in fact, it reached 88F yesterday!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-06-13 12:41:50.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by william88: Argentina? cold winter now? And you worked hard for the awesome night shot. Well done.   Thanks for the nice comment! I admit, I submitted the wrong version. There was one with not so much contrast, that I think I liked better. It can be seen here. BTW, yes, it''s winter here, but very warm... in fact, it reached 88F yesterday!', '2008-07-16 13:44:45.000000', '2014-06-13 13:41:50.000000', 0),
