(4830531, 696632, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697253" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>This is just awesome, the silhouettes are fantastic and the low pov is great. I expect the 1''s, 2''s and 3''s were from people who say it wasn''t a landscape as I can see no other reason for such low scores!! The colour of the sky also enhances this shot. This should have been in the top 10 IMHO</td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  This is just awesome, the silhouettes are fantastic and the low pov is great. I expect the 1''s, 2''s and 3''s were from people who say it wasn''t a landscape as I can see no other reason for such low scores!! The colour of the sky also enhances this shot. This should have been in the top 10 IMHO', '2008-07-17 05:37:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4830532, 696974, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697251" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>Lovely tranquil shot, the sheen from the water is fantastic as are the colours</td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  Lovely tranquil shot, the sheen from the water is fantastic as are the colours', '2008-07-17 05:38:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4830534, 696439, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697252" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>I love these long exposure water shots, I really must do some at some point!! The colour of the sky and the ''misty'' water make this a fantastic shot</td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  I love these long exposure water shots, I really must do some at some point!! The colour of the sky and the ''misty'' water make this a fantastic shot', '2008-07-17 05:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
