(4833510, 696871, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  I love the long exposure showing the skyline, San Diego Bay, boats, blue sky and great fireworks.  Someone told me Coronado was a great place to see the July 4 fireworks since you can see several of them including Sea World, Petco Park, Del Mar Fair, up and down the coast, etc. Congratulations on the blue and for getting San Diego on the front page yet again.  I took fireworks only shots at the Del Mar (ok, now it''s San Diego County) Fair but they''re nothing compared to this.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  I love the long exposure showing the skyline, San Diego Bay, boats, blue sky and great fireworks.  Someone told me Coronado was a great place to see the July 4 fireworks since you can see several of them including Sea World, Petco Park, Del Mar Fair, up and down the coast, etc. Congratulations on the blue and for getting San Diego on the front page yet again.  I took fireworks only shots at the Del Mar (ok, now it''s San Diego County) Fair but they''re nothing compared to this.', '2008-07-19 05:31:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4833621, 696315, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is only from a tower?  I''d a thunk a plane!  Love the dappled light. My company has a site at Frankfurt am Main  - those lucky dogs!</td>', 'Wow, this is only from a tower?  I''d a thunk a plane!  Love the dappled light. My company has a site at Frankfurt am Main  - those lucky dogs!', '2008-07-19 09:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
