(4836423, 696941, 68035, '<td valign="top">Peter...I see this far outstripped your expectations and justly so.  I can fully understand why you would have a stay-cation if the scenery around you is as beautiful as this.  Given that we see a lot of sunsets over lakes on DPC it takes something very special to make you stop in your tracks....Let me tell you, this IS very special<br/> <br/>Glorious composition, colours and reflection.  Adding this to my favourites and congratulations on the great score</td>', 'Peter...I see this far outstripped your expectations and justly so.  I can fully understand why you would have a stay-cation if the scenery around you is as beautiful as this.  Given that we see a lot of sunsets over lakes on DPC it takes something very special to make you stop in your tracks....Let me tell you, this IS very special Glorious composition, colours and reflection.  Adding this to my favourites and congratulations on the great score', '2008-07-21 06:55:53.000000', NULL, 0),
