(4837002, 696941, 42013, '<td valign="top">Really great score on this one, and well deserved. This is a superb landscape, stripped down to light and shapes(with a small point of interest provided by the boat) that works on every level. The V shapes are strong and funnel the view right down to the water and the boat. I agree with jonfrommk, why vacation if you can stay-cation and visit a place this beautiful. I had it pegged for a Scandinavian location.</td>', 'Really great score on this one, and well deserved. This is a superb landscape, stripped down to light and shapes(with a small point of interest provided by the boat) that works on every level. The V shapes are strong and funnel the view right down to the water and the boat. I agree with jonfrommk, why vacation if you can stay-cation and visit a place this beautiful. I had it pegged for a Scandinavian location.', '2008-07-21 14:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
