(4842891, 696315, 89341, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this scored so low, it''s a great shot. The lighting is fantastic and the detail and sharpness is great. There are lots of different shapes of buildings which makes it interesting to look at for longer than the general 3 second voting scan. I like the river going through the shot as well.</td>', 'I''m surprised this scored so low, it''s a great shot. The lighting is fantastic and the detail and sharpness is great. There are lots of different shapes of buildings which makes it interesting to look at for longer than the general 3 second voting scan. I like the river going through the shot as well.', '2008-07-24 13:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
