(4895008, 696274, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow...1 comment?! I think this is a really neat shot. It is hard to get a decent picture of fishies underwater but you captured them so clearly and still managed to preserve the deep depth of field. Lovely<br/> <br/>Edit...WOAH...basic editing?! wow...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-18 08:11:17.</i></td>', 'Wow...1 comment?! I think this is a really neat shot. It is hard to get a decent picture of fishies underwater but you captured them so clearly and still managed to preserve the deep depth of field. Lovely Edit...WOAH...basic editing?! wow...', '2008-08-18 09:10:50.000000', '2008-08-18 09:11:17.000000', 0),
